			"notes": "**Upgraded to MC version 1.21.4**\n\n* New textures for bottles of estrogen, testosterone, and large enby juice.\n\n* New Item: Bottle of oil solution (used to craft E and T bottles) \n\n* Enby Power now properly halves fall damage\n\n* Dashing is now locked into straight forward, up at 45 degree angle, up at a 70 degree angle, and straight up. Mirrored downwards as well.\n\n* Added recipe book unlocks\n\n* Added 2 new advancements  \n\n* Added French \n\n* Several bug fixes"
		},
